error[E4103]: cannot move out of `stream` because it is borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4103_async_stream_moved_while_borrowed.tarn:12:14
   |
11 |     computation := get(&mut stream)
   |                        ----------- mutable borrow of `stream` starts here
12 |     moved := stream
   |              ^^^^^^ moved here while borrowed
14 |     var op = runtime.Operation.new(&execution, computation)
   |                                                ----------- the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

